<title>USA: Pittway stake cut by Gabelli group.</title>
<headline>Pittway stake cut by Gabelli group.</headline>
<dateline>WASHINGTON 1996-11-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>A group led by New York investment manager Mario Gabelli said Wednesday it reduced its stake in Pittway Corp to 17.46 percent or 687,698 common shares.</p>
<p>In a filing with the Securities and Exchange Commission, the group said it sold a net of 13,500 shares of Pittway between September 19 and November 8 at prices ranging from $43.625 to $45.24 a share.</p>
